  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Roughly shred baby cos lettuce.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.\n• Slice tomato into thin wedges.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Slice bake-at-home ciabatta in half lengthways.\n• SPICY! Use less sriracha if you’re sensitive to heat! In a small bowl, combine BBQ sauce and sriracha.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-676a0d33555c15a993e51c7d-bf0fe8b9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into bite-sized chunks.\n• In a shallow bowl, add cornflour and a generous pinch of pepper. Dip haloumi slices into cornflour.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi, tossing occasionally, until golden brown, 2-4 minutes. Remove from heat, then add BBQ glaze, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-676a0d33555c15a993e51c7d-b33c7a12.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, toast or grill ciabatta to your liking.\n• Place the butter and garlic in a small microwave-safe bowl and microwave in 10-second bursts or until melted. Season with salt.\n• Cut toasted ciabatta into bite-sized chunks. In a large bowl combine ciabatta and garlic butter, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-676a0d33555c15a993e51c7d-a9f74bd3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a second small bowl, combine Dijon mustard, ranch dressing and the honey.\n• To the bowl with croutons, add tomato, cos lettuce, cucumber and Dijon-ranch dressing. Toss to combine and season to taste.\n• Divide crouton salad between bowls.\n• Top with buffalo haloumi to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-676a0d33555c15a993e51c7d-50413ad8.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
